When more than one operation is specified in a query, create a better 'title' name for the post type when we save it.  Currently queries with multiple operations save a title as 'query'.

With the change, the following query title would be "GetPostsTitle, GetPostsSlug"

```
query GetPostsTitle {
  posts {
    nodes {
      id
      title
    }
  }
}

query GetPostsSlug {
  posts {
    nodes {
      id
      slug
    }
  }
}
```

Main updates:
- Add a new serializer `class accounts.serializers.UserSerializer`;
- Add new field `interactions.serializers.CommentSerializer.owner` which displays owner user information.
